hubcard-lint is an unofficial tool. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Hugging Face.

Rule data bundled in src/data/snapshot.json (checked 2026-11-17):

- Pipeline task types, sub-task types and model library names are copied from the npm
  package @huggingface/tasks 0.22.16, MIT License, Copyright (c) Hugging Face.
  https://github.com/huggingface/huggingface.js/tree/main/packages/tasks
- License identifiers come from the Hugging Face Hub documentation page "Licenses".
  https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/repositories-licenses
- Space colors and SDK names come from the Spaces configuration reference.
  https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/spaces-config-reference
- The suggested_hardware list and the quoted Hub messages ("hub" field of diagnostics) were
  observed in responses of the public endpoint https://huggingface.co/api/validate-yaml to
  dummy cards on 2026-11-17. The Hub's server-side schema is not public; these values may change.

Runtime dependencies:

- js-yaml 5.5.0, MIT License — https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml
- yaml 2.9.1, ISC License — https://github.com/eemeli/yaml
